{"id":"wb-6-524","name":"东林书院","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"東林書院","text":"东林书院，又名龟山书院，创立于宋朝，复建于晚明，今位于中华人民共和国江苏省无锡市梁溪区解放东路867号。明代东林书院师徒们喜爱议论时政，称东林党，对政治影响重大。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%B1%E6%9E%97%E6%9B%B8%E9%99%A2","revisionId":93914941,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93914941","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/9d93317d07e63cb78db3a6b5.jpg","title":"Wuxi_Donglin_Shuyuan_2015.04.24_16-09-22.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Wuxi_Donglin_Shuyuan_2015.04.24_16-09-22.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/Wuxi_Donglin_Shuyuan_2015.04.24_16-09-22.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"无锡东林书院\n\n文保碑","width":320,"height":213}}